  domain Thunder
  summary "Kami of thunder."

fact orochi a Creature
  name "Yamata no Orochi"
  tradition shinto
  domain Destruction
  summary "Eight-headed serpent."

fact kusanagi a Artifact
  name "Kusanagi-no-Tsurugi"
